--     messages-block convention). Offsets count DOWN from NOW() in SECONDS
--     (row 1 = 129s ago ... last row = 0s ago = NOW()), guaranteeing
--     this conversation's MAX(created_at) is the single most recent value in
--     the whole fixture (every other conversation's own timestamp is >=1
--     MINUTE = 60 SECONDS ago — see the header note's ordering list).
--     Marker message types/forms (see docs/runbooks/phase4-batch1-inbox-reads-parity.md
--     for the full inventory + which extractor/assertion reads each one):
